    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110449" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαύλ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαῦλος</span>
			, only used of fruits, <i>coarse,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλα φ.</span>”
